    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49156" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θριγκ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>surround with a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θριγκός, [αὐλὴν] ἐθρίγκωσεν ἀχέρδῳ</span>
			<i>fenced</i> it with thorn-bushes, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.10
			</span></i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.111
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>build even to the coping-stone</i>: metaph., <i>complete, make
				an end of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτας τάσδε θριγκώσων φίλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1283
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶμα -ῶσαι κακοῖς</span>
			<i>to bring</i> the house <i>to the height</i> of misery, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				1280
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θριγκουμένη . . οἰκία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					246a19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
